  ;; declarative dismissal, etc.) without per-module JS post-swap
  ;; binding code — the graph fragment owns the contract end to end.
  ;;
  ;; The graph itself needs no library: nodes are HTML overlays, edges are SVG
  ;; paths, and the viewport is one CSS transform.
  {:name :head
   :description "Final editor `<head>` element vector — `:_editor-css-link` (cached stylesheet) + HTMX 2.x CDN. HTMX is the declarative-interaction layer the `/partials/*` fragments rely on."
